cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use PyGILE-Plus or the PyGILE course in teaching or research, please cite it as below."
title: "PyGILE-Plus: Python GeoInformatics Lab Environment-Plus"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Awasthi
    given-names: B.
