version: "2.0.0"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Geoinformatics-Lab/PyGILE-Plus"
abstract: >-
  A step-by-step course in Python and GIS for absolute beginners (39 lessons
  on real data from Nepal), and a headless Docker environment combining SAGA
  GIS, GRASS GIS, WhiteboxTools and OTB with a Python geospatial and machine
  learning stack, with a landslide susceptibility workflow.
keywords:
  - geospatial
  - GIS
  - remote sensing
  - Python
  - Docker
  - landslide susceptibility
  - education
  - Nepal
